      "cooked": "<p>Hi, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/priyankat\">@PriyankaT</a><br>\nWhat is material requisition ? Is it Material Request ?</p>\n<p>Do you mean on one MR, on some of the row, you see some Stock Qty for an Item (in a Warehouse), but on the Item (in Dashboard tab) or Stock Report, for the same Warehouse  as in MR row, there is Stock Qty = 0 ?</p>\n<p>May be the Stock Qty on MR rows are set when they are created and never updated on Stock Qty change by other actions.</p>",
